ityTargetDefault:"Default internet quality",wanQualityTargetGoogle:"Google / YouTube / Gemini route",wanQualityTargetQuad9:"Quad9 DNS route",wanQualitySourceHost:"LAN source preview",wanQualitySourceHostHint:"Optional. Shows route matching for a LAN host, but the test traffic is still generated by the router.",wanQualityPingCount:"Ping samples",wanQualityDuration:"HTTP duration limit (s)",wanQualityRunThroughput:"Run small HTTP throughput probe",wanQualitySafeAdapterWarning:"This tester is route-aware, not a fake browser speedtest. It uses small router-side probes and stores history only in the panel Docker volume, not in JFFS.",wanQualityPreviewRoute:"Preview route",wanQualityRunTest:"Run quality test",wanQualityRoutePreview:"Route resolution preview",wanQualityResults:"Quality results",wanQualityMatchedRoute:"Matched route / policy",wanQualityDownload:"Download sample",wanQualityDownloadHelp:"Small HTTP sample. Good for direction and route checks, not full ISP certification.",wanQualityUpload:"Upload sample",wanQualityUploadHelp:"Small POST sample when the target supports it. Useful for asymmetry hints.",wanQualityIdlePing:"Idle ping",wanQualityIdlePingHelp:"Latency without load. Important for responsiveness and online games.",wanQualityLoadedPing:"Loaded latency",wanQualityLoadedPingHelp:"Ping while HTTP traffic is active. Growth here means bufferbloat or congestion.",wanQualityJitter:"Jitter",wanQualityJitterHelp:"Latency variance. High jitter hurts VoIP, Discord, and games.",wanQualityLoss:"Packet loss",wanQualityLossHelp:"Even small loss can cause stutter, audio drops, and retransmissions.",wanQualityDns:"DNS time",wanQualityDnsHelp:"Name resolution time for HTTP targets. Slow DNS makes browsing feel sluggish.",wanQualityTtfb:"TTFB",wanQualityTtfbHelp:"Time to first byte. Shows remote response plus route quality.",wanQualityRemoteIp:"Remote IP",wanQualityCombinedPotential:"Router multi-flow potential",wanQualityBestSingleFlow:"Best single-flow sample",wanQuali